      <title>台美零關稅政策牽動車價結構，二手車行情恐因美製車降價而鬆動</title>
      <link>https://www.inside.com.tw/article/40773-us-taiwan-zero-tariffs-reshape-car-prices-as-cheaper-us-made-vehicles-may-weaken-used-car-market</link>
      <description>業者分析，台美汽車零關稅對二手車市整體衝擊有限，惟新古車價可能受影響，待政策不確定性消除，預期先前壓抑的購車需求將釋放，換車潮可望活絡市場交易量。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.inside.com.tw/article/40773-us-taiwan-zero-tariffs-reshape-car-prices-as-cheaper-us-made-vehicles-may-weaken-used-car-market</guid>
